    - id: 37312acb237046b08f0c7c82385c99f2
      blockGroup: 37312acb237046b08f0c7c82385c99f2
      type: markdown
      sortingKey: az
      content: |
        El modelo dimensional del taxi, en estrella:

        - **Grano:** una fila por viaje.
        - **Hecho:** fact_viajes, con las medidas passenger_count, trip_distance, fare_amount, tip_amount y total_amount.
        - **Dimensiones:** zona de origen, zona de destino (la misma tabla de zonas con dos roles), tiempo (por hora) y método de pago.

        En texto:

        ```text
                         dim_zona (origen)
                                |
        dim_tiempo ----- fact_viajes ----- dim_pago
                                |
                         dim_zona (destino)
        ```

        El mismo diagrama en Mermaid. Si Deepnote no lo dibuja, copia el código en mermaid.live:

        ```mermaid
        erDiagram
            DIM_ZONA_ORIGEN ||--o{ FACT_VIAJES : "zona_origen_key"
            DIM_ZONA_DESTINO ||--o{ FACT_VIAJES : "zona_destino_key"
            DIM_TIEMPO ||--o{ FACT_VIAJES : "tiempo_key"
            DIM_PAGO ||--o{ FACT_VIAJES : "pago_key"

            FACT_VIAJES {
                int zona_origen_key FK
                int zona_destino_key FK
                timestamp tiempo_key FK
                int pago_key FK
                int passenger_count
                float trip_distance
                float fare_amount
                float tip_amount
                float total_amount
            }
            DIM_ZONA_ORIGEN {
                int zona_key PK
                string Borough
                string Zone
                string service_zone
            }
            DIM_ZONA_DESTINO {
                int zona_key PK
                string Borough
                string Zone
                string service_zone
            }
            DIM_TIEMPO {
                timestamp tiempo_key PK
                date fecha
                int hora
                string dia_semana
            }
            DIM_PAGO {
                int pago_key PK
                string metodo_pago
            }
        ```
    - id: 275985557f2e496382328679f82bdf1d
      blockGroup: 275985557f2e496382328679f82bdf1d
      type: sql
      sortingKey: b0
      content: |
        WITH dim_zona_origen AS (
            SELECT
                LocationID AS zona_key,
                Borough,
                Zone,
                service_zone
            FROM zonas
        ),
        dim_zona_destino AS (
            SELECT
                LocationID AS zona_key,
                Borough,
                Zone,
                service_zone
            FROM zonas
        ),
        dim_pago AS (
            SELECT * FROM (VALUES
                (0, 'Flex Fare'),
                (1, 'Tarjeta'),
                (2, 'Efectivo'),
                (3, 'Sin cargo'),
                (4, 'Disputa'),
                (5, 'Desconocido'),
                (6, 'Cancelado')
            ) AS t(pago_key, metodo_pago)
        ),
        dim_tiempo AS (
            SELECT DISTINCT
                date_trunc('hour', tpep_pickup_datetime) AS tiempo_key,
                CAST(tpep_pickup_datetime AS DATE) AS fecha,
                hour(tpep_pickup_datetime) AS hora,
                dayname(tpep_pickup_datetime) AS dia_semana
            FROM viajes
        ),
        fact_viajes AS (
            SELECT
                PULocationID AS zona_origen_key,
                DOLocationID AS zona_destino_key,
                date_trunc('hour', tpep_pickup_datetime) AS tiempo_key,
                payment_type AS pago_key,
                passenger_count,
                trip_distance,
                fare_amount,
                tip_amount,
                total_amount
            FROM viajes
        )
        SELECT
            o.Borough AS borough_origen,
            d.Borough AS borough_destino,
            t.dia_semana,
            p.metodo_pago,
            COUNT(*) AS viajes,
            ROUND(SUM(f.total_amount), 2) AS ingreso
        FROM fact_viajes AS f
        LEFT JOIN dim_zona_origen AS o ON f.zona_origen_key = o.zona_key
        LEFT JOIN dim_zona_destino AS d ON f.zona_destino_key = d.zona_key
        LEFT JOIN dim_tiempo AS t ON f.tiempo_key = t.tiempo_key
        LEFT JOIN dim_pago AS p ON f.pago_key = p.pago_key
        GROUP BY o.Borough, d.Borough, t.dia_semana, p.metodo_pago
        ORDER BY viajes DESC
        LIMIT 20
      metadata:
        sql_integration_id: deepnote-dataframe-sql
        deepnote_variable_name: df_star
        deepnote_return_variable_type: dataframe
